      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;UC21&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="-1310" y="-110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The Admin opens the &quot;Accounts&quot; page, searches by email or name, filters by role and status." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system returns the account list (20 items per page). E2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="320" x="-160" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The Admin picks an account." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="415" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The system shows the account information and the number of signed-in sessions (Auth) with the violation history (Tour): tour count by status, hidden / rejected tours with reasons, reports received, the 20 latest actions. E1." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="205" width="320" x="-160" y="535" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The Admin chooses &quot;Warn&quot;, &quot;Suspend&quot; (1 / 7 / 30 days or an end date, up to 365 days) or &quot;Ban&quot;, enters a reason (1–1000 characters) and confirms. A1, A2, E6." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. The system (Auth) checks the target account is not oneself, not an Admin and not already banned; it updates the status with a conditional statement. E3, E4, E5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="1035" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="7. For suspension / ban, the system revokes every sign-in session of the account (effective at once, UC#23). E7." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="320" x="-160" y="1270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="8. The system publishes account.moderated; Notification creates an in-app notification, then sends an email; Tour writes the action log. E8." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="320" x="-160" y="1475" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="1725" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E2. No valid token → 401; not an Admin → 403; invalid parameters → 400." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="213" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E1. The account does not exist → 404 &quot;Account not found&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="355" y="568" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E6. Missing reason or invalid period → 422." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="355" y="818" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E3. Acting on oneself → 403 &quot;You cannot act on your own account&quot;; the target account is an Admin → 403." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="1023" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E4. The account is already banned (when banning / suspending) or not restricted (when restoring) → 409." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="1143" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E5. The status was just changed by another Admin → 409 &quot;The account status has just changed, please reload&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="1263" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E7. A failed device sign-out or event publish is only logged." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="355" y="1383" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E8. No email → the email is skipped, the in-app notification is still stored." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="1473" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1. Restore: the Admin chooses &quot;Restore&quot; for a suspended or banned account (reason optional); the account returns to Active. E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-510" y="1005" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A2. Suspend again (the new period replaces the old one) or ban a suspended account." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-910" y="1005" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A3. The suspension period ends: the account is treated as Active on its own, with no Admin action needed." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-1310" y="1665" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
